<title>USA: PerfectData offers Internet access service.</title>
<headline>PerfectData offers Internet access service.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerfectData Corp on Friday said it is launching an Internet access service in the Los Angeles area at a cost of $8.30 per month for unlimited use.</p>
<p>Most other Internet service providers currently offer unlimited access for around $19.95 per month</p>
<p>PerfectData plans to expand the service nationally &quot;in the near future.&quot;</p>
</text>
